{"object":"Occupation","stdCode":"OCC0115","name":"IT technical salesperson","status":1,"statusName":"Approved occupation","level":3,"versionNo":"1.1","statusLastUpdated":"2016-09-19","summary":"<p>The primary role of an IT Technical Salesperson is to sell a company\u2019s technical products and services. They need a good knowledge and understanding of the portfolio of technologies that are available. They work to maintain good relationships with existing clients, gaining repeat business wherever possible from customers both internal and external, UK or internationally. They also approach potential customers with the aim of winning new business. They maintain a thorough understanding of existing technologies and those that are emerging.</p>","overview":"Selling technical products and services, such as data storage and cloud services, for a company.","involvedEmployers":"IBM, Microsoft, Lloyds, John Lewis, QinetiQ, Accenture, MOD, BT, Cisco, NCA, Cap Gemini, Virgin Media, Fujitsu, RAF, HP, BCS","keywords":["Computer sales","ICT","IT","Sales","Sales rep","Selling"],"typicalJobTitles":[{"name":"IT Salesman","isGreen":false},{"name":"IT Salesperson","isGreen":false},{"name":"IT technical salesperson","isGreen":false},{"name":"Sales adviser","isGreen":false},{"name":"Sales agent","isGreen":false},{"name":"Sales assistant","isGreen":false},{"name":"Sales executive","isGreen":false},{"name":"Sales representative","isGreen":false}],"soc":{"soc2010Code":3542,"soc2010Description":"Business sales executives","soc2020Code":3552,"soc2020Description":"Business sales executives","soc2020SubUnitGroups":[{"code":"3552/00","description":"Business sales executives","isPrimary":true}]},"mapHierarchy":{"routeId":13,"routeName":"Sales, marketing and procurement","routeSequence":13,"pathwayId":20,"pathwayName":"Sales and retail","clusterGroupId":72,"clusterId":278,"clusterName":"Business sales support","technicalLevel":1,"technicalLevelName":"Technical","pathwaySequence":3,"clusterGroupSe